{"product":{"id":8000169181286,"title":"Selkirk OMNI Pickleball Paddle","body_html":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOMNI — Definition: of all things.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePickleball is a battle of strategy between you and your opponent. A game of aggressive attacks and defensive resets. Whether you’re making your move or trying to get back to neutral, you need a paddle that can help you work the point and win the rally. A paddle that can do it all.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Selkirk OMNI™ redefines an all-court paddle for the modern fast-paced game.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePower. Control. Spin. Durability. This foam paddle has versatile performance to support your game.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReact. Adapt. Win.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWith the Selkirk OMNI, you really can have it all.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Selkirk Sport","product_type":"Paddle","created_at":"2026-05-11T17:15:12-07:00","handle":"selkirk-omni-pickleball-paddle","updated_at":"2026-08-25T22:06:01-07:00","published_at":"2026-05-29T08:55:04-07:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"global","tags":"advanced, hybrid, intermediate, paddle, paddles","variants":[{"id":45607806271590,"product_id":8000169181286,"title":"Elongated \/ Chalk","price":"300.00","sku":"7118_OMNI-EL-WH","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Elongated","option2":"Chalk","option3":null,"created_at":"2026-05-11T17:15:12-07:00","updated_at":"2026-08-25T22:06:01-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"840309341868","grams":318,"image_id":3558